# This repository is a *released artefact*, not a source tree under active merge.
# Every file below is byte-verified against the live origin by sha256, and the
# archive's own MANIFEST.sha256.txt records those hashes. Any end-of-line
# normalisation on checkout would silently break that equality: a file would
# arrive with the right text and the wrong hash, and the only symptom would be
# a manifest check failing on a machine that never touched the file.
#
# So: no conversion, in either direction, for anything.
* -text

# Explicit, for readability -- `-text` above already covers them.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.woff  binary
*.ico   binary
